# Docker build context filter (UNC-1 harness image, tools/uat/netfault/Dockerfile). Credentials never enter a layer:
# every env-style file is excluded, and the Dockerfile copies an explicit allowlist only.
**/*.env
**/.env*
**/uat.env
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
scratchpad
**/scratchpad
.uat
.chunsik
.chunsik-tmp
.discord_tmp
data
docs
